# Important Command Questions

## Repository Initialization

### Q1. How to initialize Git repository?

```bash
git init
```

---

### Q2. How to check Git status?

```bash
git status
```

---

### Q3. How to add files to staging area?

```bash
git add filename
```

OR

```bash
git add .
```

---

### Q4. How to commit code?

```bash
git commit -m "First commit"
```

---

### Q5. How to connect local repo to GitHub?

```bash
git remote add origin URL
```

Example:

```bash
git remote add origin https://github.com/user/repo.git
```

---

### Q6. How to push code to GitHub?

```bash
git push -u origin main
```

---

### Q7. How to clone repository?

```bash
git clone URL
```

---

### Q8. How to pull latest changes?

```bash
git pull origin main
```

---

### Q9. How to create new branch?

```bash
git branch branchname
```

---

### Q10. How to switch branch?

```bash
git checkout branchname
```

---

### Q11. How to merge branch?

```bash
git merge branchname
```

