# Scenario-Based Questions

## Q1. Repository already exists. What will you do?

Clone repository first:

```bash
git clone URL
```

---

## Q2. Push rejected due to changes online?

First pull changes:

```bash
git pull origin main
```

Then push again.

---

## Q3. Forgot to add file before commit?

```bash
git add .
git commit -m "Updated"
```

---

## Q4. Wrong remote URL added?

```bash
git remote remove origin
git remote add origin NEW_URL
```

---

# Error-Based Viva Questions

## Q1. What is authentication failed error?

Occurs when username/password/token is wrong.

---

## Q2. What is merge conflict?

When two people modify same lines in a file.

---

## Q3. What is “repository not found”?

Wrong repository URL or no access permission.

---

## Q4. What is detached HEAD state?

HEAD points to specific commit instead of branch.

